-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
EDUCATIONAL & RESEARCH USE DISCLAIMER
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository is an archived software engineering case study and technical
demonstration of hybrid browser automation (Chrome DevTools Protocol viewport
coordinate projection vs. OS-level input dispatch).

It is published strictly for educational, academic, and portfolio review
purposes. Automated scraping, polling, or booking on live Driver and Vehicle
Standards Agency (DVSA) systems is prohibited by the DVSA Terms and Conditions
and Acceptable Use Policy. This software is not intended to be run against
live DVSA infrastructure, and the author(s) do not endorse, encourage, or
assume any liability for misuse of this code in violation of any third-party
Terms of Service.
